  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering disinformation and empowering democracy in North-West Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(27, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;The Centre for Journalism Innovation and Development (CJID) proposes a targeted intervention to counter the weaponization of disinformation and hate speech in Northwestern Nigeria. Our approach is designed to directly curb emerging violence by strengthening information integrity, empowering local communities with critical media literacy, and fostering a resilient information ecosystem that resists manipulation and incitement to conflict.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
